# AeroTwin - Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your keys. Never commit your real .env file.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Flask Web Application Configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FLASK_APP=app/app.py
FLASK_DEBUG=0
PORT=5000
SECRET_KEY=aerotwin-vibrant-crystal-secret-key-2026

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# External Air Quality API Keys (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenAQ API v3 Key (Required only for live OpenAQ station ingestion)
# Obtain a free key at: https://openaq.org/
OPENAQ_API_KEY=your_openaq_api_key_here

# Open-Meteo Air Quality API requires no key (free and open access)
# CPCB CAAQMS portal uses official archive files under data/raw/

